      "start_seconds": 8.21,
      "end_seconds": 12.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Right, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.34,
      "end_seconds": 19.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "mainly I've been losing weight that's why I came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
